### 3. Arbitrage Service Layer ✅

**Interface**: [ArbitrageService.java](file:///home/pranay/anotherDrive/javaCodes/crypto-price-aggregator/src/main/java/com/cryptoArb/crypto_price_aggregator/service/ArbitrageService.java)  
**Implementation**: [ArbitrageServiceImpl.java](file:///home/pranay/anotherDrive/javaCodes/crypto-price-aggregator/src/main/java/com/cryptoArb/crypto_price_aggregator/service/impl/ArbitrageServiceImpl.java)  
**Location**: [src/main/java/com/cryptoArb/crypto_price_aggregator/service](file:///home/pranay/anotherDrive/javaCodes/crypto-price-aggregator/src/main/java/com/cryptoArb/crypto_price_aggregator/service/ArbitrageService.java)

**Features**:
- [detectArbitrage(CurrencyPair pair)](file:///home/pranay/anotherDrive/javaCodes/crypto-price-aggregator/src/main/java/com/cryptoArb/crypto_price_aggregator/service/impl/ArbitrageServiceImpl.java#54-117) - Detects arbitrage opportunities across exchanges
- [getRecentOpportunities(CurrencyPair pair, int limit)](file:///home/pranay/anotherDrive/javaCodes/crypto-price-aggregator/src/main/java/com/cryptoArb/crypto_price_aggregator/service/impl/ArbitrageServiceImpl.java#118-131) - Retrieves recent opportunities

**Implementation Highlights**:
- **Manual calculations** using BigDecimal (per roadmap requirements):
  - Find minimum ask price across all exchanges (where to buy)
  - Find maximum bid price across all exchanges (where to sell)
  - If max bid > min ask, arbitrage exists
  - Calculate profit percentage: [((sellPrice - buyPrice) / buyPrice) * 100](file:///home/pranay/anotherDrive/javaCodes/crypto-price-aggregator/src/main/java/com/cryptoArb/crypto_price_aggregator/domain/CurrencyPair.java#30-45)
- Uses `@Transactional` for database operations
- Uses `@Timed` for observability metrics
- Integrates with [PriceService](file:///home/pranay/anotherDrive/javaCodes/crypto-price-aggregator/src/main/java/com/cryptoArb/crypto_price_aggregator/service/PriceService.java#10-29) to fetch latest ticks
- Persists detected opportunities to [ArbitrageRepository](file:///home/pranay/anotherDrive/javaCodes/crypto-price-aggregator/src/main/java/com/cryptoArb/crypto_price_aggregator/repository/ArbitrageRepository.java#18-51)

**Tests**: 7/7 passing ([ArbitrageServiceTest.java](file:///home/pranay/anotherDrive/javaCodes/crypto-price-aggregator/src/test/java/com/cryptoArb/crypto_price_aggregator/service/ArbitrageServiceTest.java))
- Detect arbitrage when opportunity exists
- No arbitrage detected when prices are equal
- Correct profit percentage calculation (1.0% verified)
- Handle empty ticks gracefully
- Handle single exchange gracefully
- Get recent opportunities with limit
- Verify persistence of detected opportunities

